  {
    "id": "c036",
    "name": "Exhibit A.3 Exceptions from Parcel No. 3",
    "text": "Excepting from Parcel No. 3, as set forth above, the following: 1. A 1.102 acre parcel of land conveyed to CSX, Transportation, inc., by Deed recorded in Volume 2430, Page 336, Mahoning County Official Records; 2. A 65,781 square foot parcel of land conveyed to Mahoning County by Deed recorded in Volume 3157, Page 319, Mahoning County Official Records; and 3. A 357 square foot parcel of land conveyed to Mahoning County by Deed recorded in Volume 3157, Page 322, Mahoning County Official Records."
